{{clusters}}

COMPETITOR COVERAGE GAPS (structure only):
{{competitorGaps}}

Return items with: type (missing_service_page|missing_location_page|informational|faq|comparison|supporting_article|refresh|weak_coverage), title, targetKeyword, evidence (cite the input), rationale, suggestedUrl (or null for FAQ additions), priority (high|medium|low).
